# Chapter V, the Kanzler's betrayal: once the dwarf prince is home
# (Zwergenvar 9), pairs of the Kanzler's mages wait on every road into
# Stormwend. They carry the player to Brutus in Stormwend Tower, who throws
# the player into the Gargart prison; Rakhissh cracks the locks and a dragon
# flies the player off the docks.
# Position stands in for the walks; ref FormIDs carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from verrat_arrest
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# The mages by the tournament plaza force-greet the player.
case verrat_arrest
run
player->Position -1700 34400 200 0
until 900 Zwergenvar == 10
until 300 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
bye
# In the tower VerratMarker01 gives Brutus 8 game seconds to greet before the
# Gargart message: slower from here through verrat_brutus.
pace 5
until 600 GetJournalIndex A_V_KanzlerVerrat == 1
until 600 GetPCCell "Stormwend Tower" == 1
end

# Brutus greets the player himself, asks for his stones, and sends the
# player to Gargart.
case verrat_brutus
pace 5
run
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
expect GetJournalIndex A_V_KanzlerVerrat == 2
choose 2
choose 4
until 600 GetJournalIndex A_V_KanzlerVerrat == 3
until 600 GetPCCell "Gargart, Prison" == 1
end

# In the cell; Rakhissh fights his way over and offers to crack the locks.
# His authored run-over is StartCombat on the player until he is within 150.
case gargart_cell
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_V_Gargart == 1
until 6000 "GargartRakhissh01"->GetDistance player <= 150
wait 30
talk GargartRakhissh01
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_V_Gargart == 2
end

# Out on the docks the dragon answers the call and flies the player away.
case gargart_escape
run
player->Position -48244 35600 139 0
until 900 GetJournalIndex A_V_Gargart >= 6
end
